{"unit_id":"tag:03MP:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们简要讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）的概念。请与《拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0001> 节比较。我们将在《代数空间上的下降（Descent）》命题 <REF_0002> 中证明，拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）沿这些覆盖下降（descent）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"本节概念；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章节名的词核；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"下降的层；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"层沿覆盖下降；暂译待决。"}],"notes":["原文使用 sheaves descent；按其所述下降含义翻译，来源原字节保留。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03MQ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004> 的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，其对象是代数空间（algebraic spaces），其中每个 <MATH_0006> 都是平坦（flat）的，且对每个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0007> 和态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，都存在标准（standard）fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0009>，它细化（refines）族（family）<MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"所定义及测试覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"定义中的族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"成员性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"测试对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试映射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准","context":"标准fpqc覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"细化","context":"测试覆盖关系；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"被细化的族；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03MP:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n换言之，存在指标 <MATH_0001> 及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>，使得 <MATH_0003>。注意，若 <MATH_0004> 和所有 <MATH_0005> 都是可表（representable）的，则由《拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0001>，这与概形（schemes）的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）相同。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"细化态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"与概形定义一致的条件；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"所比较的定义；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"所比较的覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFQ:statement","translation":"任何 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）都是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），因而任何句法（syntomic）、光滑（smooth）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）更是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"给定覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"结论中的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"更特殊的覆盖类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"更特殊的覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"更特殊的覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"更特殊的覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
